# Project Communication Memory

When reporting verification or check results for this project:

- Always include the local website URL the user should open, when available.
- Always include how to start the development server.
- Keep the instructions concise and actionable.

## Standard development server command

```bash
npm run dev
```

## Default local URL

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

If the port changes, report the actual URL shown by the app.
